          "text": "40",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋakirujaeta a ŋimabus a ŋiarei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apaki ace kelunyar ŋakiro ŋun, kitoŋoa ekapolon erwosit ŋolo a Ijipit ŋiketiyak keŋ lu: Ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a erwosit ka ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu epoete ŋamugati a erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toŋoik Parao ŋikapolok lu ŋiarei: Ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a erwosit ka ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu epoete ŋamugati a erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikama erwosit ikes ya kidarae alokai a ekapolokiniton ŋasigarya ŋuna a ejera a ŋolo aenitere Yosepu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicikak ekapolokiniton ŋasigarya ikes neni a Yosepu akitere ikes. Kiboiyoto ikes idaritae a nen ŋirwa ŋidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit apei nakwaare, kirujata alojera aneni aenitere ikes ŋienan ŋuluarei ŋul; ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a erwosit ka ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu epoete ŋamugati a erwosit a ŋolo a Ijipit. Agelaaka ŋakiro ŋuna abu ŋinituŋanan kiruja ka agelaana apolou a ŋakiro a ŋuna erujat ŋinituŋanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani taparacu ebuni Yosepu neni kec, kiŋolik ikes ebulit iyalaara ŋawat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, kiŋit Yosepu ŋikapolok ŋulu sek arae ŋiketiyak a Parao ŋul, ŋulu aya ka iŋes lojera ŋulu edaritae alokai a esigarit a ŋolo apolokinit ŋisigarya tema, “Nyo enyorididyoto ŋireetin kus nakoloŋit na?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋokis ikes temasi, “Irujatae isua, ido mam ituŋanan ikisileerekini isua apolou a ŋakiro a ŋuna irujatae.” Tema Yosepu neni kec, “Meere mono Akuj epedori akisileerekin apolou a ŋakiro a ŋuna irujatae a? Tolimokinae ayoŋ ŋakiro ŋuna irujato iyes.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimu ŋolo apolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a erwosit ŋuna kebu iŋes kiruja, tema neni a Yosepu, “Anakiruja kaŋ abu ayoŋ eŋolik ekitoe ŋolo a epiini, ayai kiŋaren kaŋ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayakar ekitoe ŋol ŋaten ŋauni. Ani apaki ŋinapei epuriteunio ekitoe, tolomunete ŋatur kiŋa ka tokoni enene a ŋaraito, toruwor epiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atiŋit ayoŋ ekopo a Parao apaki ŋin, ido abu olemu ŋaraito a epiini ocuki lokopo a Parao, oinak Parao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema Yosepu neni a ŋol, “Apolou a ŋakiro a ŋun iŋes na: Erae ŋaten ŋunauni ŋun ŋirwa ŋiuni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alotooma ŋirwa ŋiuni, ikilemuni iyoŋ Parao alojera, ido ikinyakak iyoŋ lotic kon. Iwuakini iyoŋ ekopo a Parao nakan keŋ lopite ŋolopei sek iwuanakinia apaki ŋina iraakar iyoŋ ŋolo ipolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a Parao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani ŋina ejokyarotor ŋakiro aneni kon, totamunitetei ayoŋ daŋ, kitoodiu arimao kon neni kaŋ; tolimoroe ayoŋ daŋ neni a Parao, itolemu ayoŋ alokai a na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kire! Aponi okokokoun ayoŋ anakwap a Ŋiburaniyae; tokona daŋ a ne, mam ŋakiro ŋuna etiyat ayoŋ, ŋuna ekewuakinitotor ikes ayoŋ lojera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani eanyuni ŋolo sek apolokinit ŋulu ipoete ŋamugati a Parao atemar ejokak ŋakiro ŋuna esileereun anakiruja a erukitos keŋ, tema neni a Yosepu, “Erujat ayoŋ daŋ nu: Abu eŋolik ewokit ŋibukito ŋiuni ŋulu aya ŋamugati ŋuna akwaŋak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tooma ebukit ŋolo ayai kidiama ŋuluce, aya ŋamuja a Parao ŋuna epotoi ŋuna agelegelya; nai akopete ŋikeny akimuj ŋin alobukit anakou kaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toboŋok Yosepu iŋes tema, “Apolou a ŋakiro a ŋuna irujat iyoŋ iŋes na: Erae ŋibukito ŋuluuni ŋul ŋirwa ŋiuni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alotooma ŋirwa ŋiuni, elemari Parao akou kon anakuwan kon, ido kinenek akuwan kon lopir, potu ŋikeny toruto akiriŋ a akuwan kon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani edolete ŋirwa ŋiuni, akoloŋit ŋina enumunumere ŋasuban ŋuna a akidouno a Parao, kitemok Parao ŋasuban aŋuna a ŋiketiyak keŋ. Tolemu alokidiŋ ŋiketiyak keŋ ŋulu aya lojera lu: Ŋolo sek apolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni keŋ ka ŋolo sek apolokinit akipore ŋamugati keŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinyakak lotic keŋ ŋolo ka ayaunun ekopo eketiyan ŋolo sek apolokinit ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo, yau iŋes ekopo inak Parao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ŋolo sek apolokinit akipore ŋamugati, abu Parao tomyed, kinenek lokitoe ikwapei sek esileereunitor Yosepu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai abu ekapolokiniton ŋulu ayaununeete ekopo neni a Parao nyetamu Yosepu, kimuryakis ŋakiro a Yosepu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
